    "updated_at": "2021-05-21T19:36:50Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the feedback, we will consider the USB device version (bcdDevice) field when adding properties to the `getInfo()` method. Implementing this is blocked on the fingerprinting and platform-specific implementation issues tracked in [Chromium issue 1074383](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1074383).",
