    "created_at": "2021-05-21T22:32:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-05-21T22:32:00Z",
    "body": "Chromium has similar code to explore the device tree and discover these properties, don't take my message as an implication that I believe it is impossible, it is just more complex than the current serial port enumeration logic (which already has some issues with buggy Windows serial drivers) and it will take some time to make sure it works correctly.\r\n\r\nOther developers who have expressed interest in the product name string have explicitly called out that it will be more useful than the product ID, which does hint at additional fingerprinting concerns but I agree with you that it is probably not a significant harm.",
